OL,3,GNEWSA'Fight on' call after solar farm
OL,4,Achallenge fails
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn anti-solar farm campaigner says he
OL,7,Fwould be "gutted" if local authorities
OL,8,F"rolled over" and stopped opposing more
OL,9,Ffarms being built.
OL,11,FLincolnshire County Council's legal
OL,12,Fchallenge to Springwell Solar Farm near
OL,13,FSleaford, the biggest in the country,
OL,14,Fwas thrown out by the High Court last
OL,15,Fweek.
OL,17,FCouncil leader Sean Matthews said the
OL,18,Fdecision "may have set a precedent for
OL,19,Fthis kind of challenge", raising
OL,20,Fquestions over the future of a legal
OL,21,Fchallenge to Beacon Fen Energy Park at
OL,22,Fnearby Heckington.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
